OL,3,GNEWSAMissed chances to save boy, 2,    
OL,4,Amurdered by grandparents despite dad's 
OL,5,Aconcerns                               
OL,7,FOpportunities to protect a two-year-old
OL,8,Fwho was murdered by his grandparents   
OL,9,Fwere missed by multiple agencies, a    
OL,10,Freview has found.                      
OL,12,FEthan Ives-Griffiths died on 16 August 
OL,13,F2021 after suffering a "catastrophic"  
OL,14,Fhead injury at his grandparents' home  
OL,15,Fin Garden City, Flintshire. He had been
OL,16,Fbeaten, starved and deprived of fluids.
OL,18,FNorth Wales Safeguarding Board         
OL,19,Fapologised "unreservedly" after a      
OL,20,Freview found attempts by his dad to    
OL,21,Fraise concerns were not acted upon.    
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
